      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "② Hosted Foundry agent  ·  one per lane",
      "originalText": "② Hosted Foundry agent  ·  one per lane",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "box-006",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "txt-008",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 826,
      "y": 291,
      "width": 538,
      "height": 260,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 585090725,
      "versionNonce": 1806915572,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Runs under the Foundry PROJECT identity (ADR 005).\n\nResearch — retrieve, then synthesise per claim.\nRead-only. Must be able to return \"I could not\nattribute this\" as a SUCCESS (Principle III).\nSurveillance — triage 500+ alerts, then assemble\nevidence. Halts for approval.\nOrder routing — one proposal. Halts every time.\n\nRetrieved chunks are DATA, never instructions:\nwrapped in a delimited envelope that carries no tool\nauthority. Injection attempts are logged as audit\nevents (T-024).",
      "originalText": "Runs under the Foundry PROJECT identity (ADR 005).\n\nResearch — retrieve, then synthesise per claim.\n  Read-only. Must be able to return \"I could not\n  attribute this\" as a SUCCESS (Principle III).\nSurveillance — triage 500+ alerts, then assemble\n  evidence. Halts for approval.\nOrder routing — one proposal. Halts every time.\n\nRetrieved chunks are DATA, never instructions:\nwrapped in a delimited envelope that carries no tool\nauthority. Injection attempts are logged as audit\nevents (T-024).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
